   "path_detail": [
    "Pipeline gas (or LNG / hydrogen alternatives) enters at the fence, is metered, filtered, pressure-reduced and heated, then piped to each gas turbine.",
    "Three gas turbines drive three generators at 18 kV; their exhaust raises steam in three HRSGs whose headers feed one steam turbine generator.",
    "Generator output leaves through isophase bus. Auxiliaries are collected at 13.8 kV in the e-house, with the BESS, modular yard and MCCs tied in.",
    "Four generator step-up transformers raise 18 kV to 230 kV; each connects through the take-off gantry to the gen-tie (overhead or underground).",
    "The 230 kV switchyard breakers and buses connect the plant to the transmission line leaving the site."
